%YAML 1.1
%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 7ed8d592803d6492b8f1f0ac1555a1ea, type: 3}
  m_Name: ModuleTargets
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: InsightsSamples.Common::InsightsSamples.Common.SampleInfo
  id: 16-module-targets
  number: 16
  title: Module targets
  series: Sessions & courses
  icon: target
  scenario: LMS-assigned forklift pre-shift check
  realWorld: "A logistics company assigns forklift pre-shift checks through its LMS: tires, forks, and controls, in a set order. The headset opens whichever module the LMS asks for, and results flow back to each learner's LMS record."
  teaches: OnModuleTarget, GetModuleList, OnAllModulesCompleted
  sceneName: ModuleTargets
  appWidePrefab: {fileID: 5484178059005661310, guid: 964c864b7c0994b529b2eefb48486493, type: 3}
  whatThisShows: Every route into a module (its button, an LMS target, or a deep
    link) goes through one entry point, and each module is its own assessment named
    by the module ID.
  tryThis:
  - Open the Tires module and tag the forklift out to pass; call it safe to fail.
  - 'Open a module by deep link: ?sample=16-module-targets&module=preshift_forks.'
  - 'Try an unknown target (&module=preshift_brakes): it logs a warning and shows
    the module list.'
  watchFor:
  - EventAssessmentStart and EventAssessmentComplete named by the module ID.
  - With an LMS sequence, OnModuleTarget rows from the SDK (System filter).
  lessonScript: ModuleTargetsSample.cs
  lessonScriptLine: 70
  dashboardNotes:
  - methodPrefix: EventAssessment
    note: Assessment results per module, which LMSs report as module completion
  - methodPrefix: Log
    note: 'Logs: developer diagnostics'
  expectedOnPass:
  - method: EventAssessmentStart
    name: preshift_tires
    count: 1
    atLeast: 0
    status: 
  - method: EventAssessmentComplete
    name: preshift_tires
    count: 1
    atLeast: 0
    status: Pass
  expectedOnFail:
  - method: EventAssessmentStart
    name: preshift_tires
    count: 1
    atLeast: 0
    status: 
  - method: EventAssessmentComplete
    name: preshift_tires
    count: 1
    atLeast: 0
    status: Fail
